  "body": "<!-- THESIS: Living connections should feel alive: learning and community have equal doors.\nOWN-WORLD: Original soil brown and forest with cooler taupe and sage surfaces; original type families; rounded photographic windows and tactile pill controls.\nSTORY: Look into the soil, see the people, follow curiosity, join the conversation.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: 72px left-hand headline and equal actions alongside a four-part 20-second film sequence, circular soil photograph and mycelium capsule.\nFORM: The user's pinned Cabana reference overrides the direction roll 38b50a19. Cabana image-in-type and rounded media; Organimo depth; Motion Primitives state transitions.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"dock\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"dock-brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><span class=\"dock-rule\"></span><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a><a href=\"/common-ground/\">Forum</a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"dock-menu\" type=\"button\">Explore <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M4 8h16M4 16h16\"></path></svg></button></nav>\n<dialog class=\"site-menu\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-top\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/><button aria-label=\"Close menu\" class=\"icon-button\" data-close-menu=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"menu-body\"><div class=\"menu-intro\"><p class=\"display-small\">Knowledge grows.<br/>So do we.</p><p>Free learning. Shared experience.<br/>A more connected way forward.</p><img alt=\"Hands holding living soil\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/e6089057-a04-hands-4880be9d4b40-1400.webp 1400w\" width=\"1400\"/></div><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"/videos/\">Videos<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/courses/\">Courses<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/common-ground/\">Forum<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/events/\">Events<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/about/\">My story<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/newsletter/\">Newsletter<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/feedback/\">Feedback<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a></div></div></dialog><main id=\"main\"><header class=\"page-heading has-art\"><h1>What’s on<br/>your mind?</h1><div class=\"page-heading-side\"><p>Your feedback matters to us. Tell us how we can make your permaculture journey better.</p><span class=\"meta\">A conversation starts here</span></div><div class=\"page-heading-art\"><img alt=\"Hands sharing a meal around a table\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-1400.webp 1400w\" width=\"1400\"/></div></header><section class=\"section contact-layout\"><div><img alt=\"Hands sharing a meal around a table\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-1400.webp 1400w\" width=\"1400\"/><p>A suggestion, a question, a resource to share.<br/>We’re listening.</p></div><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/myceliumlearning@gmail.com\" class=\"contact-form\" method=\"post\"><div class=\"name-fields\"><label>First name<input autocomplete=\"given-name\" name=\"first-name\" required=\"\"/></label><label>Last name<input autocomplete=\"family-name\" name=\"last-name\" required=\"\"/></label></div><label>Email address<input autocomplete=\"email\" name=\"email\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/></label><label>Your message<textarea minlength=\"5\" name=\"message\" required=\"\" rows=\"6\"></textarea></label><p class=\"form-note\">We use your name, email, and message only to read and reply to your feedback. <a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy policy</a>.</p><button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\">Send message</button><p class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\"></p></form></section></main><footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer-intro\"><p class=\"display-small\">Good things grow<br/>when we connect.</p><p>Connecting scattered permaculture knowledge into clear learning pathways. Free, verified, and built for beginners ready to grow.</p></div><div class=\"footer-links\"><div><h3>Learn</h3><a href=\"/videos/\">Videos</a><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a><a href=\"/courses/\">Courses</a><a href=\"/events/\">Events</a></div><div><h3>Connect</h3><a href=\"/common-ground/\">Forum</a><a href=\"/about/\">My story</a><a href=\"/newsletter/\">Newsletter</a><a href=\"/feedback/\">Send a message</a></div><div><h3>Elsewhere</h3><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mycelium.learn/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@JoaquinRiego\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></svg></a><button class=\"plain-button\" data-d=\"moc.liamg\" data-email=\"\" data-u=\"gninraelmuilecym\" type=\"button\">Show email address</button><a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy policy</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-signature\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/><span>Rooted in learning. Connected by people.</span></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© 2026 Mycelium Learning</span><span>Independent permaculture education · Philippines</span></div></footer><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"toast\" role=\"status\"></div>"
